+++ autofs-5.1.7/CHANGELOG
@@ -193,6 +193,7 @@
 - remove unnecessary call to set_direct_mount_tree_catatonic().
 - remove unnecessary assignment in umount_multi().
 - fix direct mount trigger umount failure case.
